OL,3,GNEWSAFive arrested as counter-terror
OL,4,Apolice investigate major incident near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive men have been arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of preparing a terrorist act
OL,9,Fand explosive offences after three
OL,10,F"suspicious vehicles" were reported
OL,11,Ftravelling towards an RAF base, police
OL,12,Fhave said.
OL,14,FA major incident was declared and
OL,15,Fdozens of homes near RAF Fairford in
OL,16,FGloucestershire were evacuated
OL,17,Ffollowing the report at about 00:45 BST
OL,18,Fon Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
