OL,3,GNEWSAFive arrested as counter-terror
OL,4,Apolice investigate major incident near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Army explosive ordnance disposal
OL,8,Fteam has been examining vehicles near
OL,9,Fthe base, which is used by the United
OL,10,FStates Air Force (USAF), as
OL,11,Fcounter-terror police lead the
OL,12,Finvestigation.
OL,14,FResidents evacuated from the nearby
OL,15,Fvillage of Whelford have been told they
OL,16,Fwill not be able to return home
OL,17,Fovernight, but officials say they
OL,18,Fbelieve the incident is contained.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
